 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "NC State・種: 初夏に摘心（pinching back）すると生育が促される、を「初夏に草丈を詰める」と読んで C。花後の切り戻しで秋に返り咲く（NC State・stauden.de・Gaißmayer）、晩秋に地際で切る（RHS）。株分けは約3年ごとで D ではない。摘心の目的が草丈とは書いていないので読み方に幅がある。機械は空欄",
  "management_type_quote": "In early summer, pinching back the foliage will stimulate the plant's growth.",
  "management_type_by_matching": null,
  "heat_west_only": "強",
  "muggy_west_only": "強",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[NC State/種] It is adaptable to clay soils, moist and dry conditions, and hot, humid weather.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: East-facing or South-facing or West-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 2／NC State・種] Kalimeris is a flowering, rhizomatous, herbaceous perennial native to Southeastern Siberia, northern China, and central and southern Japan and is a member of the daisy family (Asteraceae).\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] 地下茎：言い回しの照合では 2、文を読み直して 空欄（[NC State・種] rhizomatous ... clump-forming（広がる明記なし））",
  "mixing_evidence": "[stauden.de・種] Wuchsverhalten: horstig, lockerhorstig, horstbildend",
